                        ],
                        "form": "more longtime"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "983c6184-26c7-4635-beaf-a51ae35de939",
                        "entry_id": "80826632-9341-3efd-b496-12db72c670ab",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most longtime"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be020f23-8c42-3727-bec2-9ebf30baee3d",
                        "entry_id": "80826632-9341-3efd-b496-12db72c670ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having endured for a long period of time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fbd70cf-52e1-4b98-b5f1-4c2213a9daa1",
                                "sense_id": "be020f23-8c42-3727-bec2-9ebf30baee3d",
                                "text": "My longtime friend, since birth actually, called and gently broke the bad news to me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d3429a8-d7e7-4d8a-8c34-b22453bcf75b",
                                "sense_id": "be020f23-8c42-3727-bec2-9ebf30baee3d",
                                "text": "longtime favorite"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cbf5229-122b-4d63-bb6f-d7e6c02a2834",
                                "sense_id": "be020f23-8c42-3727-bec2-9ebf30baee3d",
                                "text": "It was an outgrowth of Jobs's embrace of 60's counterculturalism -- he was a longtime, and rather irritating, vegetarian and lived in a commune."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab9c99f3-b397-4c56-ae9d-767115a5ce95",
                                "sense_id": "be020f23-8c42-3727-bec2-9ebf30baee3d",
                                "text": "Criminal justice reform has become a national topic of discussion given recent police killings of Black men, and Jones points out that he's been a longtime activist on this issue, with his experience in Palo Alto and as an NAACP youth organizer. Also, he notes, as a Black man, \"People like me are overpoliced, overarrested, overprosecuted.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
